## Key Resources

### Font Identification
- **WhatTheFont Tool:** Advanced AI-powered font identification from images
  - Web version: https://www.myfonts.com/pages/whatthefont
  - Android app: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.monotype.whatthefont
  - iOS app: https://apps.apple.com/in/app/whatthefont/id304304134
  - **WhatTheFont Usage Requirements:**
    - Maximum file size: 5MB
    - Text must be clearly visible and large enough
    - Text should be in Latin script (Aa-Zz)
    - Characters must not overlap
    - Text should be straight, not skewed
    - Submit only one line of text at a time
    - Use "Select Custom" option for manual text selection

